statement=('Let b>=5,k>=5,m>=1 be integers, rho=2^-b,d=2^-k, g_k be -1 only at allzero on k controls plus one output x, G the product of m disjoint g_k blocks, mu=(1-d)^m<1/8, V a fresh b-bit point,A=V(1-G)/2,p=rho(1-mu)/2,h=chi_u off A and chi_q on A,F=1 at fresh gate0 and h*w at gate1 with flat two-bit mask w=[-1,1,1,1]. Supply ORIGINAL Qh=(Ph+delta_q)/2 and QF(e,T)=[Qh(Tcore)Pw(Tmask)+delta_empty(T)]/4 at BOTH gate frequencies, retaining the original nonnegative insertion debit U=Lq+Econv of REPORT. The original source obeys H(G)<4I(G) and the original full root obeys4I-CE>19/8. Query q, then all k controls in each block. Clean each inactive output x and, when M=0 active outputs remain, all irrelevant padding too; retain ALL physical outcomes and literal ORIGINAL marginal references. At every final leaf ALL remaining physical coordinates are essential. M is Binomial(m,d), the true remaining source is a signed character for M>0, and its inherited CE=kM,I=M,H=0. Hence the EXACT posterior-weighted source excess is rho*md*(k-4), and its remaining KL is kmd on average. Writing pi=1-mu, the exact complete nonempty-source outer CE is rho[(2b+7)pi+kmd]/4; averaging BOTH q signs gives4EI=6+(b-1)rho*pi+rho*md. The complete inherited CE obeys0<=E CE-rho*k*md/4<2b+8+rho(2b+7)/4, and true H(F_leaf)<4, so full KL has the same leading coefficient with remainder in(-4,2b+8+rho(2b+7)/4). In particular m=2^(b+k+4) gives E[4I-CE]-U<22+b2^-b-4k<-9 for b>=5,k>=8. On b=k=t>=8 this reserve tends to minus infinity while actual outer neighboring-q disagreement p/2<2^-t/4 tends to0. For EVERY fixed real K>=4 the SAME roots are rateK eligible but this completely cleaned frontier has E[KI-CE]-U<6K-4t, hence fails eventually. Moreover, after this frontier ANY finite adaptive continuation querying only surviving source outputs, with padding,u,mask,gate untouched, that restores nonnegative expected rateK reserve when k>K must leave E L<=K(6+2b*rho)/(rho*(k-K)) outputs unqueried. On the diagonal the surviving fraction is at mostK(6+2b*rho)/(16*(k-K)), so it must reveal all but O(1/k) in expectation. This refutes root-rate-only arbitrary-clean-frontier eligibility, not the prior hereditary cleaned-source contract or FEI. The bad policy is not asserted necessary for every FEI stopping rule.')
hypotheses=['Uniform independent PHYSICAL bits. Fourier entropy and complete cross-entropy in bits; influence uses literal uniform-cube edge disagreement.','The BALANCED original hierarchy is fixed before any query. No reference reset, support renormalization, discarded physical sibling, renewed bank or extra credit for retired influence.','Every source block has k private control bits and one output bit; blocks are disjoint. This source is a product of actual Boolean point-defect gates, not an arbitrary spectral probability vector.','The displayed all-outcome frontier queries q and all source controls, and erases ALL irrelevant source outputs plus M0 padding, retaining every cleanup outcome. Fresh u,mask,gate remain unqueried.','The continuation necessity applies to output-only continuations from this frontier, with all physical outcomes and the same nonnegative U; it is necessary, not sufficient.','This is a complete-terminal functional statement. A separate accumulated query-KL transaction ledger is not claimed paid.']
