report='# A019 stage22: essential mismatch survives complete physical cleanup\n\nFull FEI remains OPEN. An eligible original source can reach a complete adaptive frontier with negative inherited-reference reserve even after EVERY irrelevant physical bit is cleaned. The exact remaining source KL is kmd, and the full outer debt has leading coefficient rho*k*md/4. Every fixed rateK>=4 fails on this chosen frontier; a selected useful stopping rule may avoid or bundle it. The theorem is author-checked with exact certificates; independent review is pending.\n\n'
