report+='## '+fields[2]+'\n\n'+(R/'out/DERIVATION.md').read_text(encoding='utf-8')+'\n\nThe original debit is literally Lq=log2((9+p^2)/8)/2+(p^2/8)log2((9+p^2)/(1+p^2)) and Econv=(1+p^2/4)[1-h2((1+p/2)^2/(2(1+p^2/4)))]/2. As in the independently accepted stage21 proof,0<=Econv<=p^2,Lq<1/2+p^2/2,so0<=U<5/8. Upper-bound counterexample signs use only U>=0. No new debit replaces the old one.\n\nFirst unsupported UNIVERSAL line: provide a necessary useful stopping/admission rule that avoids or pays the essential mismatch from an unused ORIGINAL account, together with a noncircular arbitrary-core supplier. Root FEI alone does not make its original spectrum a hereditary cheap reference. A source block can be completed before admission; whether proper blocks or equivalent useful bundles exist universally is not proved.\n\n'
report+='## '+fields[3]+'\n\nFROZEN_SPEC.json precedes the pilot. Before any search the k5m1b1 fixture was added explicitly to exhibit positive essential-source excess, rather than only k1,2 identity diagnostics. Pilot `python -B -X utf8 code/check_essential.py --pilot`: PASS1111 exact assertions,0.0233seconds,k1m2b1. First main: PASS8810,0.4938seconds; that receipt is preserved as CHECKS_SOURCE_CLEANUP_ONLY.json. A pre-rerun amendment keeps the SAME domain and adds M0 padding cleanup,then checks every remaining physical coordinate is essential. Final main: PASS13996,0.5327seconds. The count changed because these full-cleanup/support/edge checks were added,not because dimensions increased.\n\nThe main domain is exactly (k,m,b)=(1,2,1),(2,2,1),(1,3,2),(5,1,1):60 full control patterns,both q signs,120 complete profiles. Equal physical cleanup children are collapsed ONLY after direct equality and frequency-marginal checks,with their entire reach retained. All q/controls/cleanup outcomes remain in the exact average. Literal integer Walsh spectra of the ORIGINAL balanced core are computed before marginalization; leaf references are compared to the proposed product formulas. Full outer spectra,physical edges,sector masses and exact power-of-two code lengths are recomputed. Six single-block spectra k1..6 carry integer entropy<=4I certificates saved in hexadecimal to avoid decimal conversion limits. Analytic inequalities supply all-k/m signs; finite tests are not an infinite proof.\n\nAUDIT_FROZEN_SPEC.json precedes `python -B -X utf8 code/audit.py`: PASS7336 exact assertions,96 sector/reference profiles,0.4240seconds. This separate implementation uses DIRECT character sums and full physical truth tables,not the main butterfly helper. It rederives all six source spectra and original x-frequency marginals. Both q signs and M0 boundaries are present. CONTINUATION_FROZEN_SPEC.json precedes `python -B -X utf8 code/continuation.py`: PASS108 exact assertions,32 physical output-continuation terminal cases,0.0288seconds,including constant-1 and constant+1 exits. The necessary all-policy bound then follows by literal finite averaging,not a numerical sample. Main+audit+continuation total21440 substantive exact assertions; pilot and superseded main excluded.\n\nAdversarial checks covered source and global cleanup,all remaining bits essential,original reference versus reset,M0,source phase,both q signs,coincident principal/empty atoms,exact reaches,sector coefficient,source entropy eligibility,normalization and support. No mathematical test failed. Supporting log intervals use the pinned stage21 rational40-term atanh helper with positive remainder; no floating sign is used. The main obstruction uses exact power-of-two code lengths,integer source certificates and analytic all-dimensional inequalities.\n\nFresh memok passed with6.5GB physical and15.8GB commit free. Exact scripts are estimated60--120MB; every computation is under60seconds,no heavy search,GPU or detached job. A Core-Lean-only scalar statement was submitted with target essentialDebt,reviewed source SHA2567043becfc40af3cd78ce1bc00c3c46e8fa1ebed85c68cd1c0f6ad5e35acc13f4 and45second timeout. It returned RUNTIME_UNVERIFIED after48.5seconds; no Lean certificate or axiom acceptance is claimed. The scalar statement only expresses (k-4)m+4m=km after clearing common reach,not the Fourier/probability proof. Mathlib\'s estimated4.1GB route exceeds the1.5GB packet cap and was not started. Rung: analytic proof with exact certificates,external peer review pending.\n\n'
report+='## '+fields[4]+'\n\nThe new obstruction has a self-contained actual Boolean source,explicit original reference,all-outcome physical partition and all-dimensional proof. The only carried interface is the balanced complete-reference definition,with elementary latent coding rederived for root eligibility. This does not refute A019 stage21 or A018\'s extension: both require the hereditary cleaned-source contract. Here even a single regular point gate with k>=5 has a cleaned essential literal costing k>4 under its original marginal. Actual source entropy there is0; only its original-reference KL is large. True FEI for restrictions cannot substitute for a compatible code bound.\n\nThe earlier stage20/A020 counterexamples used ghosts; the new counterfamily survives complete PHYSICAL cleanup,and defeats every finite fixed K>=4 as an arbitrary-prefix invariant. Exact source cleanup releases<2md while essential KL left behind is kmd. A separate accumulated physical-query KL transaction is not inferred free from the terminal functional,consistent with the A094/A012/A097 board warnings. Independent code representations are not independent peer acceptance. No previous registered theorem is refuted and no FEI counterfamily is claimed.\n\n'
