report+='## '+fields[6]+'\n\nAll four protocol files,code,frozen specifications,exact finite outputs,source hashes and Lean unverified receipt are saved locally. out/PERSISTENCE_RECEIPTS.json validates requested fields,statement hash,byte-identical PROGRESS/PACKET_DELTA,report headings,and file sizes/SHA256. Rolling STATUS has two lines; WORKLOG/LEARNED append the dated exact lesson and NEXT. Supervisor copying,registry adoption,remote mirrors and independent review of this theorem remain unverified. Worker git,brain writes,mail and other-agent mutations were not used.\n\nThe first source-receipt one-off failed because Path(\'.\') was not resolved before navigating to the prior run; the corrected reproducible reader passed. Two checklist working updates failed because its shared lock was held too long; no lock or process was removed. SETUP_DIAGNOSTICS preserves these nonmathematical blockers. A final checklist completion is attempted separately. Brain self-care is degraded/unverified: owner-model,state-of-mind,dream notes are stale and affect personal-context reliability; none is a mathematical premise. The current compute snapshot showed6.2GB disk free and running CPU load; no work was stopped or throttled. No detached research job was launched.\n\n'
